  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "是超Z隊的人啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8D85005A968A76844EBA554A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳很強是吧，\n這話題在鏽蝕組裡聊得可熱絡了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F885F37662F5427FF0C000A90198A71984C572893FD87557D4488E1804A5F9753EF71B17D614E863002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得來勁的時候，\n就跟我打一場吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F974F8652C1768466425019FF0C000A5C318DDF621162534E00583454273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z隊的小<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā弟妹，打算跟我打一場時，\n就告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A968A76845C0F00100003110000FF01015F1F59B9FF0C62537B978DDF621162534E0058346642FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E00807254273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有幹勁喔～\n要現在就開打了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67095E7952C15594FF5E000A898173FE57285C31958B62534E8655CEFF1F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開打吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B62535427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鋼屬性的堅硬程度！\n就是我信念的堅定程度！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "92FC5C6C602776845805786C7A0B5EA6FF01000A5C31662F62114FE15FF5768458055B9A7A0B5EA6FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼啊，難不成要找我喝茶？\n都來搭話了，不如就跟我打一場吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBC554AFF0C96E34E0D62108981627E6211559D8336FF1F000A90FD4F86642D8A714E86FF0C4E0D59825C318DDF621162534E00583454273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還真是個隨和的傢伙啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39084771F662F500B96A8548C768450A24F19554A3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然打輸了就要表示一點意思，\n我說個私藏的故事給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713662538F384E865C3189818868793A4E009EDE610F601DFF0C000A62118AAA500B79C185CF768465454E8B7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D54273002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鋼不被毒所染！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "92FC4E0D88AB6BD2624067D3FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說年輕時的吉普索先生\n一頭迷上了比自己更年輕的烏羽先生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA5E748F15664276845409666E7D225148751F000A4E00982D8FF74E0A4E866BD481EA5DF166F45E748F15768470CF7FBD5148751F3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，烏羽先生他可是個用毒的，對吧！\n毒雖然會魅惑對手，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但也可能會侵害烏羽先生他自己。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C70CF7FBD5148751F4ED653EF662F500B75286BD27684FF0C5C0D5427FF01000A6BD296D6713667039B4560D15C0D624BFF0C00100001BE00000A4F464E5F53EF80FD67034FB55BB370CF7FBD5148751F4ED681EA5DF13002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以啊，聽說吉普索先生他\n時不時會盯著盔甲鳥們看，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n藉此振作自己，\n以免被毒給過度魅惑了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5554AFF0C807D8AAA5409666E7D225148751F4ED6000A66424E0D6642670376EF845776D475329CE55011770BFF0C00100001BE01000A85C96B64632F4F5C81EA5DF1FF0C000A4EE5514D88AB6BD27D66904E5EA69B4560D14E863002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這故事很無聊，不過也挺好的吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n公司的二號人物有這樣的心態，\n我們這些下面的人也就安心了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901965454E8B5F887121804AFF0C4E0D904E4E5F633A597D76845427FF1F00100001BE01000A516C53F876844E8C865F4EBA7269670990196A2376845FC3614BFF0C000A6211501190194E9B4E0B976276844EBA4E5F5C315B895FC34E863002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這東西就當是謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳陪我認真打了一場，\n還聽了我說無聊的故事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196771897F5C317576662F8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3966A62118A8D771F62534E864E005834FF0C000A9084807D4E8662118AAA7121804A768465454E8B3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今後也請多指教啦。\n烏羽先生的小跟班，超Z隊小<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā弟妹！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA5F8C4E5F8ACB591A6307655955663002000A70CF7FBD5148751F76845C0F8DDF73EDFF0C8D85005A968A5C0F00100003110000FF01015F1F59B9FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今後也請多指教啦。\n烏羽先生的小跟班，超Z隊小<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā弟妹！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
